OL,3,GNEWSAFrench bike ride for friend with
OL,4,Abrain tumour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of golf-loving retirees are
OL,7,Fplanning their toughest challenge yet,
OL,8,Fto cycle from London to Bordeaux, to
OL,9,Fraise funds for Yorkshire's Brain
OL,10,FTumour Charity (YBTC).
OL,12,FThe six men, all in their 60s and from
OL,13,FHarrogate, hope to raise at least
OL,14,F#35,000 for the organisation after a
OL,15,Ffriend's wife was diagnosed with
OL,16,Fterminal brain cancer.
OL,18,F"We felt we had to do something - we
OL,19,Fwanted to do something," says Simon
OL,20,FGrafton, who came up with the idea for
OL,21,Fthe 480 mile (770km) ride.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
